## Summary

Implemented REQUIRED `wbActivityType` field for WB risk group firecells to enable accurate validation against CAS2 Table 1.1 storage height limitations.

**Status:** ✅ COMPLETE (All 57 integration tests passing)

**Implementation Date:** 2025-10-02

