## CAS2 Table 1.1 WB Activity Types & Storage Rules

| Activity Type | Examples | Storage Height Limit | Floor Area Limit |
|--------------|----------|---------------------|------------------|
| **professional** | Offices, law practices, laboratories, workshops | **< 3.0m only** | None |
| **industrial** | Factories, manufacturing plants (excluding foamed plastics) | **< 3.0m only** | None |
| **storage** | Warehouses, storage buildings, general storage areas | **≤5.0m:** No limit<br>**5.0m-8.0m:** ≤4200m² | See left |
| **temperatureControlled** | Temperature controlled storage facilities | **<3.0m:** No limit<br>**3.0m-5.0m:** ≤500m² limited areas<br>**>5.0m:** Non-compliant | See left |
| **intermittent** | Light aircraft hangers, fixed plant/machinery, spray painting | Not specified in Table 1.1 | None |

