## Implementation Details

### 1. Data Model (ProjectModel.js)

**Added validation** (lines 140-151):
```javascript
// WB: Validate activity type (REQUIRED for Table 1.1 compliance)
if (firecellData.riskGroup === 'WB') {
  const validWbTypes = ['professional', 'industrial', 'storage', 'temperatureControlled', 'intermittent'];

  if (!firecellData.wbActivityType || typeof firecellData.wbActivityType !== 'string') {
    throw new Error('WB activity type is required and must be a string');
  }

  if (!validWbTypes.includes(firecellData.wbActivityType)) {
    throw new Error(`Invalid WB activity type: ${firecellData.wbActivityType}. Must be one of: ${validWbTypes.join(', ')}`);
  }
}
```

