## Migration Strategy

### Chosen Approach: Require Manual Update

Existing WB firecells will fail validation when loaded and require users to select an activity type before proceeding.

**Rationale:**
- Table 1.1 compliance is critical for fire safety
- Users need to understand WB sub-types
- Prevents incorrect assumptions
- Ensures clean data going forward

**User Experience:**
- Form will show validation error if `wbActivityType` is missing
- User must select appropriate activity type from dropdown
- Help text guides correct selection

